# A real person's voice is not published by accident.
#
# The board looks for recordings here, and copy_from_bedside.sh will put them here so it works
# on this machine. Whether they belong in a PUBLIC repository's permanent history is a decision
# (README.md sets out the three ways to answer it) — so until that decision is made, git does
# not see them. Remove this file to publish them.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.m4a
